---
title: Ask turn — one Pi Agent, six tool families, one event bridge
---
%%{accTitle: "Ask mode is one loop, not a graph. The chat:sendStreamMessage pump in src/main/ipc/chat-handlers.ts starts an ActiveTurn (its own AbortController plus a monotonic seq) and awaits runAskTurn in src/main/services/pi/ask-turn.ts, which builds one Pi Agent per turn over every bound tool family at once. There is no intent classifier and no conditional edge: the model routes by choosing a tool, and pi/families.ts maps that name to a family, an agent label and a display label. pi/ask-events.ts translates Pi's typed AgentEvent union into the six-variant AskStreamEvent — token, agent, step-start, step-complete, ui-payload, sources — which the pump pushes over chat:stream-chunk, chat:thinking-step and chat:agent-change, each stamped with seq. The final chunk carries uiPayloads, sources and metrics, where metrics is only durationMs and model. pi/turn-record.ts writes one trajectory row per completed turn. chat:cancelTurn aborts the controller; withAbort makes sure the run settles even if the model never answers. The AskGraph drawn here previously — classify, three subgraphs, postProcessNode, MemorySaver and the node registry — was deleted at the Pi cutover."}%%
flowchart TB
  classDef node fill:#0a0a0a,stroke:#38bdf8,stroke-width:2px,color:#fafafa;
  classDef term fill:#1b1b1b,stroke:#5b6470,color:#fafafa;
  classDef fake fill:#161305,stroke:#a87500,color:#e8d9a0,stroke-dasharray:5 4;
  classDef fam fill:#0a0a0a,stroke:#7c5cff,stroke-width:2px,color:#fafafa;

  U(["user query, history (last 10 turns), attachments"]):::term
  PUMP["chat:sendStreamMessage pump — src/main/ipc/chat-handlers.ts<br/>beginTurn(): ActiveTurn controller + seq<br/>120 s ASK_PUMP_TIMEOUT_MS"]:::node
  RUN["runAskTurn() — src/main/services/pi/ask-turn.ts<br/>ONE Agent per turn: thinkingLevel off, toolExecution sequential<br/>10 min ASK_RUN_TIMEOUT_MS inside withAbort + withTimeout"]:::node
  PROMPT["buildAskSystemPrompt(sessionId, bound, query) — pi/ask-prompt.ts<br/>advertises only families whose toolbox is non-empty<br/>appends buildBrowserSkillSection(query) when browser is bound"]:::node

  U --> PUMP
  PUMP -- "await runAskTurn(req, onEvent)" --> RUN
  RUN -- "system prompt" --> PROMPT
  PROMPT --> RUN

  ROUTE{"the model routes<br/>by CHOOSING A TOOL<br/>no classifier · no conditional edge · no checkpointer"}:::term
  RUN --> ROUTE

  subgraph FAMS["Six tool families — pi/ask-tools.ts binds them, pi/families.ts indexes them"]
    direction LR
    DESK["desktop — 32 TypeBox tools<br/>pi/toolbox.ts via getDesktopToolbox()"]:::fam
    WEB["web — search_web, fetch_page<br/>pi/tools/web-tools.ts"]:::fam
    UI["ui — create_table, form, comparison, list, chart<br/>each returns details.uiPayload"]:::fam
    DOC["document — create_docx, pptx, xlsx,<br/>read_document, modify_document"]:::fam
    BR["browser — browser_-prefix FILTER<br/>over the one shared MCP connection"]:::fam
    MC["mcp — the same connection's<br/>non-browser_ tools, [] when unconfigured"]:::fam
  end
  ROUTE --> FAMS

  DUP["buildFamilyIndex() THROWS on a duplicate tool name<br/>Pi resolves a call by name, so a collision makes one family unreachable"]:::term
  FAMS -.-> DUP

  TRANS["AskEventTranslator — pi/ask-events.ts<br/>exhaustive switch over Pi's AgentEvent union<br/>token · agent · step-start · step-complete · ui-payload · sources"]:::node
  FAMS -- "AgentEvent stream" --> TRANS

  PUSH["chat:stream-chunk · chat:thinking-step · chat:agent-change<br/>every push stamped with the turn's seq<br/>step label from FamilyIndex.displayLabelFor(), step = tool name verbatim"]:::node
  TRANS --> PUSH
  PUSH --> RENDER(["renderer: useChatSession folds steps, ThinkingSteps renders the timeline"]):::term

  FINAL["terminal chunk: uiPayloads + sources + metrics<br/>metrics = durationMs + model ONLY<br/>no length/4 token count, no hard-coded price"]:::node
  TRANS --> FINAL

  REC["pi/turn-record.ts → saveTrajectory()<br/>one row per completed turn, repeated tool calls kept per occurrence"]:::node
  FINAL -.-> REC

  CANCEL["chat:cancelTurn threadId<br/>controller.abort() → agent.abort()<br/>user Stop · pump timeout · normal completion"]:::term
  CANCEL -.-> PUMP

  subgraph GONE["Deleted at the Pi cutover — do not draw or cite these again"]
    direction LR
    G1["AskGraph · getAskGraph · classify · routeAfterClassify"]:::fake
    G2["browserSubgraph / documentSubgraph / desktopAgent node"]:::fake
    G3["node-registry.ts: ASK_GRAPH_NODES, NODE_AGENT_MAP, RESPONSE_NODE_SET"]:::fake
    G4["MemorySaver checkpointer · clearGraphCache() · AskState reducers"]:::fake
  end
